{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "bdc456af51e3d9f8da76dd8fd9ea88cf254b4a999e9847bb1151dd39f22c9319", "ja": "特訓の成果！", "zh": "特训的成果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "902fc66c732bdce6342dff4d91a72ffa46c54d6fd608373cf90e8531df3bdc57", "ja": "特訓の成果が見られるエターナルハーモニー\nのメンバー。そんな中、まつりが今の自分達\nがどれだけ上達したか、腕試しをしてみたい\nと言い、みんなも賛成する。ジュリアの提案\nで、路上ゲリラライブを行うことに。", "zh": "眼见『Eternal Harmony』成员特训有成，\n茉莉表示想测试彼此现在有几分实力，\n其他成员也纷纷赞成。\n于是在茱莉亚的提议下，\n众人决定举办街头演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d39f69e939561ed875aa58d0c1109b1135dbafce74d2553cc189cea4493fcaf2", "ja": "みんな、レッスンお疲れさま。調子はどうだ？", "zh": "大家，训练辛苦了。状况如何啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "d9627a09c88eaa5ecb9e3488c380aea375014bed84e7a30547b578acc372cede", "ja": "お疲れさまです、仕掛け人さま。\nおかげさまで、歌も舞も、上達してきたと思います♪", "zh": "您也辛苦了，策划执行人先生。\n多亏有您的协助，我认为唱歌和跳舞都有所长进♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "1727fe660bf24784d6d08004ae8d5485c6f5bc3bd78f267906bba3c311ae3415", "ja": "エミリーの歌、すごくよくなったよ。\nま、あたしのダンスは、まだまだだけどな……。", "zh": "艾蜜莉的唱功大有长进喔。\n哎，我的舞倒是还差得远了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ff806afbe5ae72e51a75786c84590b419e878897cfc2e002291fef749cd0f942", "ja": "そんなことないよ。ジュリアちゃんのダンスだって、\nとっても上手になってるよ♪", "zh": "没这回事啦，\n茱莉亚的舞也进步很多喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "049261e90e517c5275bbea5bc8e932a05af2eb62ce766351574f659168e48199", "ja": "フーカ、それホントか？\nはは、努力の成果が出てきたってことかな♪", "zh": "风花，你是说真的吗？\n哈哈，那就是努力开始有成效了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "4962e2fd28d67b00d3a3ab7724b97b2ac0d8b171b028a7956cc7627f6a77dfe8", "ja": "……はいほー！", "zh": "……Hi Ho！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "15b376f732af9afff3da9c44163a204287e07d98b943275fb7d0e0a15d608f78", "ja": "？　徳川さん、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "嗯？德川，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "966e2c5497082c06f2e035715233f43a935fc26af16cdb7e56dc9b71ff2eeaa7", "ja": "千早ちゃん、{$P$}さん。姫たちが\nどれくらい上達したか、試してみたいと思いませんか？", "zh": "小千早，{$P$}先生。\n你们不想测试看看公主我们进步了多少吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "10796f651bd02b2c45b7ef3a9dafef750e6386cb8cdbd078872ead12722612dc", "ja": "試す……というと……。", "zh": "测试……意思也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "23711847241e3738dd8af98e94b82733aacc54ea4ae75b5f5503f0acb2f122e6", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんたちは、ライブの前にショッピングモールで\nミニイベントをやったと聞いているのです。", "zh": "听说小琴叶她们曾在演唱会前，\n到购物中心内举办过小型活动的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "004fd7067f5e0848e2a93156fd99cde6d8db0d4a6b31cddada309a8d75b18ce2", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n姫たちも、何かやってみたいのですー！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n公主我们也想试着办个什么活动的唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "10dd047e84ce33a0aaeb01ad289c8b924747811c784b94eb227e63d7022bff0e", "ja": "なるほど、本番公演前の、小規模舞台ですか……。", "zh": "原来如此，正式公演前的小规模舞台是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8da71dee672108f11895b0a0d8cb98e562f7bc99d3cf5b4d973ec22e24baa045", "ja": "しかし、何かと急に言われても……\n今のところ、イベントの予定はないしな。", "zh": "不过，你突然说想办活动……\n目前也没什么活动预定啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5db632337bbd34a42f7611e0513458c78ff37687835d8d99941b1b6101705604", "ja": "今から会場を取るにしても、急ですしね。", "zh": "现在才开始找场地，也太仓促了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "038f116bdc6309de0ebfa12841bddbd135c4615b36105af140da8cdfe85653f6", "ja": "いや……あたしに、いい考えがある。", "zh": "不……我有个好主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "eafc615280f12f5dcffddad9f6d10271d7f8badce65fb10c254c80a90338e648", "ja": "ジュリアさん？", "zh": "茱莉亚？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "db161ce2d7424213593b790c69341da7d23f3f2ca02e5d0523a6133c1dde5280", "ja": "腕試しがしたいってコトだろ？　だったら、\n路上でゲリラライブってのはどうだ。", "zh": "意思就是想试试看自己的能耐对吧？\n既然如此，到街头办演唱会怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "e690bc65427538e8067194f81137e828a41ab99ccde5cd3e7200389a957d4a44", "ja": "あたしがよく行くトコなんだけど、許可が通りやすい\nから、いろんなヤツが演奏してるんだ。", "zh": "有个我常去的地方，那里很容易就能取得许可，\n所以有各路音乐人会在那里演奏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "aba15df84b825284e6adf22b217f1bd98e82573f8dfa89eae042ee9ca7fbd521", "ja": "路上ライブか……。", "zh": "街头演唱会啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "0369314a7763a58caf1056d8cbeb09a9cfe45d45853a9e1fed0fb48bd43348c5", "ja": "路上で強襲舞台……。通りすがりの方々の前で、\n私たちの歌を披露する、ということですよね？", "zh": "街头的突袭舞台……意思是要在路过的行人面前，\n表演我们的歌曲对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "56ca5a098e40e87cb5aadb83edf6ba60fd2f8b18a7a9e1b3d964bd61a196e787", "ja": "私たちを知らない人たちばっかりってことだよね……\n聴いてもらえるのかな？　ちょっとドキドキするね。", "zh": "也就是说，现场几乎都是不认识我们的人……\n他们会愿意听我们演唱吗？真让人有点紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "7e3c431776d9612e58d052f35f4da5478f97cbc6623b98038ceff2697b8e6997", "ja": "通り過ぎられても、当たり前。\nちょっと立ち止まってもらえたら、ラッキー。", "zh": "就算人家直接走掉，也是正常的事。\n只要有人愿意稍微停下来看，那就算运气好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "e01790e73aaa2b8f4710df9dbb996ccb68e2a63d8d2ca9b6969b3468316ed8df", "ja": "でも、それで盛り上がったりしたら最高！\nそれが路上ライブの醍醐味さ♪", "zh": "不过，要是能在这种条件下带动起气氛，那就太棒了！\n这就是街头演唱会的有趣之处♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "8260a63fdf35e0b6cf3433540ac91ad2db0d739e36cc76f771fb6f26975bef39", "ja": "それなのです！　まつり達のわんだほー！な\nパフォーマンスで、みんなを足止めにするのです！", "zh": "没错的喔！要用茉莉我们美妙的表演，\n来让大家停下脚步的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "a54e9116452dfcd256252e644caaba6607be6243c045a81ceb782905c446a52b", "ja": "……いいかもしれませんね。路上ライブは、きっと\nエターナルハーモニーにとって大きな経験になるはず。", "zh": "……好像不错呢。对『Eternal Harmony』来说，\n街头演唱会应该会是一次宝贵的经验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "b152337a290a46c52c99f2a29eea4f246bb358c1ba41d801d1763a030790050d", "ja": "{$P$}。\n急で申し訳ありませんが、手配をお願いできますか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n抱歉突然提这种要求，能拜托你去安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "b10a3408c2f53bba90711269c253841b93296d1e951d1d40f4af78423e11626c", "ja": "今の私たちが、どれだけの人を引きつけられるのか。\n試してみたいんです。", "zh": "我想试试看现在的我们，\n能够吸引到多少人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "435bb7983aa4dcc6dbcab0af546d0713e44950a725ffcd444c94a5b9a92e7710", "ja": "そうか。だが、路上は劇場と違って\n完全なアウェイだ。それでもいいんだな？", "zh": "这样啊。但街头和剧场不一样，\n对我们来说完全是客场，这样也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "3ead69678ca3fd921dfedbf6239c7abab5122376cb6d8aa7ab5c92737b55b560", "ja": "はい……望むところ、ですから。", "zh": "是的……我求之不得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "398847db4d2a426fd053fa5b406b404d079de26c52727994bc3f6cdbe023f1f0", "ja": "いつもと、違う景色を見てみたい。その上で\nエターナルハーモニーの公演を迎えたいんです。", "zh": "我想先见识看看与平时不一样的景色，\n再迎接『Eternal Harmony』的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a0f71d5914cd924d5421c0a423e17e8898472c9e5c99586f8859499b7ea56758", "ja": "わかった。それじゃ早速、申請してくるよ。\nみんなはレッスンを続けていてくれ。", "zh": "好，那我马上就去申请。\n大家先继续训练吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "ee8db1e2feee71417d27fe653bb134a413da89fda482b6904f5e3d23c4ce87a5", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。\n这件事就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "475aea0e56e7e16a7ce32bbce9109e00e79ff290c372c64fa508dc2b583b13cc", "ja": "ライブの許可、無事に下りるといいね。", "zh": "希望能顺利取得办演唱会的许可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "9732dbafb96a4d58d39d6bfef7e78d0969bbc27d36f9ebb5e6bb45d2ad84d27b", "ja": "大丈夫だって。あたしも何度かやってみたけど、\nダメだって言われたことないしな。", "zh": "放心啦，我自己也办过几次，\n从来都没被打回票啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "efa1fab609df44602b000a2a5e8705f5a206754173081290a0830fc8932b5989", "ja": "まあ……ではジュリアさんは、\n路上強襲舞台の達人なのですね！", "zh": "哎呀……意思也就是说，\n茱莉亚是街头突袭舞台的专家是吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "d8d4ae17fefa6bc25df906db14af75b88ca560422f267cb2b71013ccf1ef0447", "ja": "ははっ！　達人かどうかはわからないが、\nゲリラライブ慣れはしてるかもな。", "zh": "哈哈！我是不知道算不算专家啦，\n但我对街头演唱会还算熟悉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_05_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "a73be18a47e1d0328f19a4da808186a1eb6014d9da490479a84f51652178a2ff", "ja": "ゲリラライブで大切なのは、ノリと勢いだ。\nとにかく、歌うことを楽しもう！", "zh": "办街头演唱会最重要的，就是要有热情和气势。\n总而言之，记得享受演唱就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
